@startuml Leader Address Access Process

title Process: the Convoy Leader sees destination addresses
caption Target design. Decisions X7, X9, X11, X12, X13, O26, O1. Plans 17 and 19. Gated by a security review.

|Convoy Leader|
start
:Open the checklist page;

|Freedom|
if (Caller is the current leader of this convoy?) then (no)
  :Refuse (403);
  stop
else (yes)
endif

if (Within 14 days of planned departure,\nand convoy not arrived?) then (no)
  :Show route point headers only\n(name and kind);
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|Convoy Leader|
:Ask to reveal addresses;
:Re-authenticate;

|Freedom|
:Audit the read (capacity and convoy)\nin the same transaction;
:Read the route and all Receiver addresses\non this convoy through the sensitive path;
:Show them on the page only\n(never printed, logged or stored on the phone);

|Convoy Leader|
:Lead the convoy to each destination;

|Freedom|
if (Leader reassigned, or convoy arrived?) then (yes)
  :Access ends;
else (no)
endif

|Ground Officer|
:Review the access log;
stop

@enduml
